# Opening the classroom door: blood across the blackboard, a drag trail down
# the aisle to a covered body; then the bloody student is right there.
# First-person jump-scare, full screen 320x180, seen through the protagonist's
# eyes. Show the frames in order over about a second after a quiet build-up,
# with the jumpscare sound; with "reduce flashing" on, show the last frame
# only, without flicker.
# GORE SET (optional): part of the gore option; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../jumpscares/jumpscare_fp_gore_classroom.png
@preview ../previews/jumpscare_fp_gore_classroom_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame room





















































































































































































@frame there




















































































































































































